<%- include('../partials/head') %>
<section class="hero" style="padding:56px 0 64px"><div class="container">
  <span class="eyebrow"><%= brand %> Accreditation Program</span>
  <h1>Accreditation employers can verify</h1>
  <p>Accredited providers issue certificates through <%= brand %>, giving every graduate a credential with independent, real-time verification.</p>
  <div class="actions"><% if (publicApply) { %><a class="btn gold lg" href="/apply">Apply for Accreditation</a><% } else { %><a class="btn gold lg" href="/contact">Request Information</a><% } %><a class="btn ghost lg" href="/contact">Talk to us</a></div>
</div></section>
<section class="section white"><div class="container">
  <h2>Why accredit with us</h2>
  <div class="grid g3 mt">
    <div class="card"><h3>Trust at a glance</h3><p class="muted">A verification seal and QR code on every certificate, linking to a live status page.</p></div>
    <div class="card"><h3>Your brand, our assurance</h3><p class="muted">Certificates carry your logo, colors and signatory, backed by an independent verification layer.</p></div>
    <div class="card"><h3>Built for scale</h3><p class="muted">Issue thousands of certificates by CSV or integrate your LMS through our REST API.</p></div>
  </div>
  <h2 class="mt" style="margin-top:48px">The process</h2>
  <div class="grid g4 mt">
    <div class="card"><div class="step-n">1</div><h3>Apply</h3><p class="muted small">Submit your organization profile online.</p></div>
    <div class="card"><div class="step-n">2</div><h3>Review</h3><p class="muted small">We review your courses, instructors and assessment methods.</p></div>
    <div class="card"><div class="step-n">3</div><h3>Approval</h3><p class="muted small">On approval, issuance is enabled in your portal.</p></div>
    <div class="card"><div class="step-n">4</div><h3>Ongoing quality</h3><p class="muted small">Periodic review keeps your accreditation active.</p></div>
  </div>
  <h2 style="margin-top:48px">Standards alignment</h2>
  <p><%= brand %> review criteria reference recognized frameworks, including ISO 45001 (occupational health &amp; safety management), ISO 9001 (quality management), ANSI/ASSP Z490.1 (criteria for safety, health and environmental training), and US OSHA training requirements, where relevant to the course.</p>
  <div class="alert info small"><strong>Important:</strong> <%= brand %> is an independent organization. Alignment with a framework does not mean endorsement, certification or approval by ISO, ANSI, ASSP, OSHA, PMI or any other standards body or government agency. Accreditation by <%= brand %> is not a government license.</div>
</div></section>
<%- include('../partials/foot') %>
